":"choice_prompt","source_node_id":"3","source_node_type":"__DT.MultiChooseNode","statementID":"1028120002","action_index":"","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"让我把逸散的魔力完全吸收，看完最后的回忆吧……","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:6:1028120003:0":{"key":"say:6:1028120003:0","kind":"say","source_node_id":"6","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1028120003","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"伊温，你没想好要不要出去吗？嗯……这个问题要是问我的话...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:7:1028120004:0":{"key":"say:7:1028120004:0","kind":"say","source_node_id":"7","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1028120004","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"芙拉贝尔，我……我想永远留在这里，帮助所有塔兰河抚育的生灵。","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:8:1028120005:0":{"key":"say:8:1028120005:0","kind":"say","source_node_id":"8","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1028120005","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"我是不是……很没出息？","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:9:1028120006:0":{"key":"say:9:1028120006:0","kind":"say","source_node_id":"9","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1028120006","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"怎么会呢？无论在哪里，你的力量都会化成温柔的雨滴。","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:10:1028120007:0":{"key":"say:10:1028120007:0","kind":"say","source_node_id":"10","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1028120007","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"落在情人之愿，就能滋润这里的花草；落在水中，就会随着塔...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:11:1028120008:0":{"key":"say:11:1028120008:0","kind":"say","source_node_id":"11","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1028120008","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"伊温，这样很好呀！你知道自己最想要的是什么，这也是一种勇气！","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:12:1028120009:0":{"key":"say:12:1028120009:0","kind":"say","source_node_id":"12","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1028120009","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"我……勇气？","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:13:1028120010:0":{"key":"say:13:1028120010:0","kind":"say","source_node_id":"13","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1028120010","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"当然了！面对陌